# | Advantech ADAM-4117 — 8-Channel Analog Input Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4100-modbus.pdf (Appendix B, B.1)
# | - 8-channel isolated analog input; configurable range per channel via type code.
# | - Modbus RTU enabled when FF parameter bit 2 = 1; default is ADAM ASCII protocol.
# | - FC02 addr 200-207 (00201-00208): Burn-out flag ch 0-7 (R).
# | - FC03 addr 0-7: Current Value ch 0-7 (R); s16 ×0.1 engineering units (range-dependent).
# | - FC03 addr 200-207: Type Code ch 0-7 (R/W).
# | - FC03 addr 210-213: Module name 1-2, firmware version 1-2 (R).
# | - FC03 addr 220: Channel Enable bitmask (R/W, 0x00=none, 0xff=all).
# | - Factory defaults: address=0, 9600 baud, 8N1.
