@model=ADAM-4117
@description=8-channel isolated analog input. Configurable range per channel via type code (±10V, 0-10V, 4-20mA, etc). FC03 addr 0-7: s16 ×0.1 engineering units. Burn-out via FC02 addr 200-207. Modbus enabled when FF parameter bit2=1.
